  "steps": [
    "Take 1 red bell pepper, char it directly on the flame as shown in the video. Once done, remove from flame and remove the burnt part using a knife. Then cut into pieces.",
    "Blend this along with- 2 soaked Kashmiri red chillies, 10-12 soaked cashew nuts, 100gms paneer, 4 garlic cloves, 100gms hung curd (strain all the water from normal curd), 1/4 tsp black pepper powder, 1/4 tsp oregano, salt.",
    "Garnish with oregano and chilli flakes and it’s ready!",
    "Pro tip- keep this in the fridge for 30 minutes before if you want a more thicker consistency!"
